# Pre-optimization asset originals. Kept locally as the archival copy and
# deliberately outside public/ so Vite does not copy them into the deploy.
# Derivatives are regenerated with scripts/optimize-models.mjs.
.asset-originals/
public/models/*.orig.glb
public/models/*.opt.glb
